# lint-alloc.allow — the std-allocation ratchet ledger (fallible-allocation program).
# Companion: scripts/lint-alloc.sh (twin enforced copy: crates/_support/seams_init/tests/).
# Authority: owner ruling 2026-09-15 — allocation failure surfaces as ERROR 53200,
# never a process abort (docs/bug-campaign-20260913/LANE-FALLIBLE-ALLOC-REPORT.md).
